# ID_SENTENCE | IS_DISTINCT | MAX_NUM_COL | ID_SENT_TYPE | ID_GROUP_OBJECTS | OWNER_FLAG | OWNERSHIP | USABILITY | FILTER | FILTER_GROUP | APISQL
SAR_SIJP_HR_ROLE | 0 | 0 | 1 |  | 80 |  |  | ( #I >= ? And #I <= ? And ( #I <= ? Or #I > ? ) ) Or ( #I < ? And ( #I > ? Or #I >= ? ) ) |  | SELECT @SCO_ID_HR = A.SCO_ID_HR, @SCO_OR_HR_ROLE = A.SCO_OR_HR_ROLE, @SCO_OR_HR_PERIOD = A.SCO_OR_HR_PERIOD, @SCO_DT_START = A.SCO_DT_START, @SCO_DT_END = A.SCO_DT_END, @SCO_MAIN_ROLE = A.SCO_MAIN_ROLE FROM &SCO_HR_ROLE A WHERE (( A.SCO_DT_START >= @SAR_P_DT_INICIO And A.SCO_DT_START <= @SAR_P_DT_FIN And ( A.SCO_DT_END <= @SAR_P_DT_FIN Or A.SCO_DT_END > @SAR_P_DT_FIN ) ) Or ( A.SCO_DT_START < @SAR_P_DT_INICIO And ( A.SCO_DT_END > @SAR_P_DT_FIN Or A.SCO_DT_END >= @SAR_P_DT_INICIO ) )) ORDER BY A.SCO_DT_END DESC
